{"steamAppId":3677860,"description":"Nearly destroyed, a delicate but highly advanced robot awakens to a city in crisis. A dominating robotics manufacturer has disappeared in the midst of addressing a dangerous malfunction in their models.\nWhat caused all this destruction? And can it be stopped?\nWhat will you become to find out?\nFEATURES\nUnique movement mechanics allow a broken city to become your playground\n\nTake advantage of your small size and parasitic abilities to get the upper hand on challenging enemy encounters\n\nSolve innovative puzzles by redirecting power sources and manipulating the abilities of different robots\n\nClear your way across diverse levels ranging from deserted industrial sites to luxury office complexes\n\nOriginal soundtrack\n\n CAUTION!\nRobots hate bugs. They will not hesitate to crush, burn, shock, soak, or otherwise destroy them on sight.","short_description":"Entering Host is an action-puzzle platformer. Guide a fragile, robotic spider through the aftermath of a glitch that turned robotic companions into machines of destruction. Use your unique abilities to solve puzzles, outsmart enemies, and uncover the conspiracy behind the disaster.","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677860/dd924e9b61f6f9d2c9533b65eeac2b5eac2f5205/header.jpg?t=1784480068","developer":"NickSchemes","publisher":"NickSchemes","genre":"Экшены, Приключенческие игры, Инди","platforms":["Windows"],"modes":["Один игрок"],"playerCount":0,"releaseLabel":"20 авг. 2025 г.","comingSoon":false,"metacritic":null,"metacriticUrl":null,"steam":83,"steamReviewCount":6,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677860/713d79eb2bf448f44c733c6ff1fc9baa70931ff8/ss_713d79eb2bf448f44c733c6ff1fc9baa70931ff8.600x338.jpg?t=1784480068","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677860/713d79eb2bf448f44c733c6ff1fc9baa70931ff8/ss_713d79eb2bf448f44c733c6f